<title>USA: Horizon/CMS CEO recovering from surgery.</title>
<headline>Horizon/CMS CEO recovering from surgery.</headline>
<dateline>ALBUQUERQUE, N.M. 1996-12-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horizon/CMS Healthcare Corp said on Tuesday its chairman and chief executive, Neal Elliott, was recovering from cancer-related surgery.</p>
<p>The company said he would continue to serve as chairman and CEO while he recuperates and undergoes additional preventive therapy in coming weeks.</p>
<p>Elliot would be supported by an interim management committee comprised of senior executives, Horizon/CMS said.</p>
